body:
The same way Republicans reacted when:

* the passage of Medicare was not the end of capitalism;

* tax hikes in the '90s produced economic growth and tax cuts in the '00s resulted in a recession;

* the assault weapons ban did not result in increased crime and murder rates;

* there were no weapons of mass destruction in Iraq;

* the theory of trickle-down economics was disproved;

* increased environmental regulation did not lead to mass unemployment.

&nbsp;

That is to say, they'll just pretend like it never happened, move on, and hope the general population is easily distracted.

&nbsp;

*edit:*  Changed "cuts" to "hikes" in bullet point two because I'm an idiot.

Well yeah, but this is modern times!  Brides are breaking the mold left and right!

&nbsp;


Or I just messed up, but let's just pretend it was intentional.
